{"ticker":"LULU","updated":"2026-10-30T22:57:21Z","profile":{"longName":"lululemon athletica inc.","shortName":"lululemon athletica inc.","sector":"Consumer Cyclical","industry":"Apparel Retail","country":"Canada","website":"https://corporate.lululemon.com","fullTimeEmployees":39000,"marketCap":12421178368,"trailingPE":8.826338,"forwardPE":12.403682,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":1.1196349,"pegRatio":1.11,"targetMeanPrice":103.66429,"targetHighPrice":255.0,"targetLowPrice":44.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":28,"recommendationKey":"hold","revenueGrowth":-0.043,"earningsGrowth":-0.059,"grossMargins":0.54895,"operatingMargins":0.13212,"profitMargins":0.12782,"totalRevenue":11093954560,"beta":0.922,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":225.98,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":90.38,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NMS","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.0},"summary":"lululemon athletica inc., together with its subsidiaries, designs, distributes, and retails technical athletic apparel, footwear, and accessories for women and men under the lululemon brand in the United States, Canada, Mexico, China, Hong Kong, Taiwan, Macau, Greece, and internationally. It offers pants, shorts, tops, and jackets for athletic activities, such as yoga, running, training, and other activities. The company also provides fitness-inspired accessories. It sells its products through company-operated stores; seasonal stores, pop-ups, university campus retailers, and yoga and fitness studios; outlets; Like New, a re-commerce program; and its e-commerce website. The company was founded in 1998 and is based in Vancouver, Canada.","summary_zh":"lululemon sportsa inc. 及其子公司在美國、加拿大、墨西哥、中國、香港、台灣、澳門、希臘和國際上以 lululemon 品牌設計、分銷和零售男女技術運動服裝、鞋類和配飾。它提供適合運動活動（如瑜伽、跑步、訓練和其他活動）的褲子、短褲、上衣和夾克。該公司還提供健身配件。透過公司自營商店銷售其產品；季節性商店、快閃店、大學校園零售商以及瑜伽和健身工作室；網點；像 New 一樣，一個再商業程序；及其電子商務網站。該公司成立於1998年，總部位於加拿大溫哥華。","sector_zh":"週期性消費","industry_zh":"服飾零售","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-02","o":199.81,"h":201.27,"l":195.58,"c":200.21,"v":4433500},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":201.3,"h":203